        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n7. The parties are not at issue that any operation of a slaughter house, as on date, has to be in accordance with the provisions of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and after requisite permissions provided under the said Act have be"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f450577824e54604bb4077f50b3db857_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is also not in dispute that these permissions have not yet been obtained by the petitioner on account of the communication dated 16.4.2019, which stated that the licence of the petitioner had been cancelled.\n8."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b79466b283af47d9b1ffa9e72491c37b_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Insofar as the resolution dated 4.10.2018 is concerned, a careful perusal of the agenda of the meeting of the said date shows that there was no agenda item regarding the slaughter house in question."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "03892b8e06e84ec09c06b79819f2c4f5_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The resolution itself is a single line resolution bereft of any reasons."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ff1e13c853a14a11a0aac1cba0f16ef3_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In any case, the resolution is silent insofar as the contract between the petitioner and the respondents entered into on 6.10.2012 is concerned."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5835954affd2484693abe1a041cb2cae_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. We also find substance in the submissions that although the resolution was only for the closure of the slaughter house with immediate effect, the communication sent to the petitioner talks of cancellation of the licence which, therefore,"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "95ac6c91b94141fb831915db6ea4c0e5_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n10. Counsel for the respondents has not been able to justify the resolution dated 4.10.2018."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "263b19e511784bf699c2d7aa06dc08fc_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He has also not been able to show that there was any agenda item for consideration insofar as the slaughter house is concerned."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d3c7cb0426714669ad2dd23d1713c41a_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Nor has also he been able to justify as to why the communication dated 16.4.2019 talks of cancellation of the licence of the petitioner although there is no such mention in the resolution passed in the meeting on 4.10.2018."
      },
